  "visual_findings": [
    "18/60/110 m: cream window arches, shutters, cornices and layered balconies/awnings are visible from the same chase camera and form a consistent facade design.",
    "160 m: appearance remains essentially unchanged. These four frames do not demonstrate a whole-track redesign.",
    "No new obvious mesh clipping, road/curve-marker/player/HUD obstruction or text clipping was observed in the reviewed race views.",
    "Garage wall ribs, floor panels, podium markings and tool drawers give the same original Comet/Lumo clearer spatial context. Face, goggles, proportions and suit appear preserved; model hash is unchanged.",
    "All three layouts retain visible selection, Back and Next. Phone view selector fits as Rundum, where the baseline label was cut.",
    "Fold retains a scroll-constrained list showing only its first kart card in this frame. Existing statistics remain very small. The new decorative wall slogan is also small at phone/fold size; original colorful background remains busy."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Stills cannot prove absence of temporal z-fighting, clipping through all camera transitions or valid touch hit areas.",
    "Race fixture is staged at zero speed with reduced motion. It does not prove a complete race, looping/ramp traversal, animation timing or input behavior.",
    "Known preexisting Gecko boot/body clipping remains open in the separately documented side-view diagnosis; final Comet/front stills do not retest it.",
    "Race and garage counters have different scopes. These desktop snapshots are not FPS or Android temperature/RAM benchmarks. No physical Android/Fold verification by this review."
  ],
